  "releaseNotes": "fix(SQL): retry transient pre-login/TCP-drop faults in TestConnectionString (SqlException error 64, class 20 \"A connection was successfully established with the server, but then an error occurred during the pre-login handshake ... The specified network name is no longer available\") with exponential backoff before surfacing, so a momentary connect-time network blip no longer raises a false-positive Trello card. IsTransientError now recognises the pre-login handshake drop (PSDO-2576). Bumps AssemblyVersion 2026.2.03.02 -> 2026.2.03.03.",
